{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 167151, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111499, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "新偶像队 （内容搬家）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1663221185, "updated_at": 1663221816, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1663226405, "last_at": 1686821235, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "前言1、新偶像队并不是DC常规风格的：大，漏，色。他们是真的设计精美，角色可爱，以及惊世骇俗的2D演出效果。2、你大哥还是你大哥除了隔壁同公司的妮姬还有谁3、估计新角色不是做不出这么好是经费和想不想的", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1634758567380_77906856.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7663, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 167151, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、新偶像队并不是DC常规风格的：大，漏，色。他们是真的设计精美，角色可爱，以及惊世骇俗的2D演出效果。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、你大哥还是你大哥除了隔壁同公司的妮姬还有谁</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、估计新角色不是做不出这么好是经费和想不想的问题哈哈）</span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">正文</span></span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">1、全员圣诞节主题，带翅膀装饰。（游戏中还有很多其他圣诞主题形象天子例如辅助真神格里拉）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">2、被击动作大家自己在游戏中看吧，录制工作量太大，篇幅太长。展示效果也不好。</span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">偶像队常设状态（开头为点击屏幕-攻击动作）</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">稳重队长土星：</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1、头部发卡的白花有点像新娘的花嫁，戒指戴在了无名指上，突出的就是成熟稳重<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">人妻</span>，我还没看剧情具体就补多说了。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、与海王星一样没带手套，与金星翅膀款式相似。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、整体2D演出效果非常流畅，翻手动作动画级别。</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"560\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/418255.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/418255.gif\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/418255.gif\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"5\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;font-size:16px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">可爱小透明海王星：</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;1、2D演出效果非常流畅且优秀没有违和感，妹妹头（胳膊）、格里拉（小腹）哭晕。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、全队唯一，一套可穿戴装备：海王星的麦克风、鞋子、发卡（图标和立绘稍有差异）</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"560\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/713278.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/713278.gif\" style=\"\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">“性感</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">”</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">恶魔火星：</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、画风很新但是设计上感觉没有老马尔斯那时惊艳，毕竟老马尔斯是血罗画的萝莉</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、甜蜜和蔼动作流畅，五人中大腿最粗小腿最细（略有奇怪）。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、裙子内衬的样式像是小雪人手拉手，除发卡还带了一顶公主皇冠。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、性感是他自己说的。</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"560\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/775665.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/775665.gif\" style=\"\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">古灵精怪金星：</span></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、2D演出效果不错，服装会随着手臂放下而落下也会随手臂抬起而撑起。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、头上像角像拉炮一样的装饰会动，除了自身在扭动再用脚趾打节拍，三位使用有线麦克中唯独带底座的，这个麦克风看着有种时代感。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、放DS时是播放待机动作的前3秒，眼睛不停的眨。</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"560\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/930760.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/930760.gif\" style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,164,211);\">金星好可爱哦</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">时装叛徒亚里亚</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、偶像队唯一不以行星命名，出道最早？（待我补完剧情）</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、2D动作略有小瑕疵，这个服装像是C位。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、五人唯一拥有其他皮肤角色，氪金皮确实好看。（<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">我没买穷</span>）</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、旧偶像队她也是拥有大量皮肤。</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"560\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/299908.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_560/1069/87565/2022/7/27/299908.gif\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1634758567380_77906856.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1634758567380_77906856.png\" data-width=\"922\" data-height=\"1024\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1634758567380_77906856.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 500px; height: 555px;\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">偶像队群体DS</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、素材录制没有想象中那么简单，用最好的电脑也难以60FPS毫秒级播放五位天子DS，没办法只能每秒60帧逐帧调整同步。</div><div style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2、<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">站位分配天子朝向为主，以及服装样式为辅。</span></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; 视频可全屏观看&nbsp; &nbsp; 1080P 60FPS</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"video-play-wrapper\">\n                      <p class=\"video-title\"></p>\n                      <div class=\"img-video-div\"><img class=\"uploadVideoImg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/15/87951.png\" data-url=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/video/1069/87565/2022/8/15/331962.mp4\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"165\" style=\"display: inline;\" data-title=\"\" data-is_hot=\"0\" data-isb=\"1\">\n                     <i class=\"icon-video-play\"></i>\n                      </div>\n                    </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">普清GIF DS（800×265/30FPS）15MB</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img data-width=\"800\" data-height=\"265\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_265/1069/87565/2022/7/27/886767.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_265/1069/87565/2022/7/27/886767.gif\" st